<title>NEW ZEALAND: Newmarket reports flat annual profit.</title>
<headline>Newmarket reports flat annual profit.</headline>
<dateline>WELLINGTON 1996-09-12</dateline>
<text>
<p>Year to June 30.</p>
<p>			   (million NZ$ unless stated)</p>
<p>    Net profit				  4.63 vs 4.60</p>
<p>    Shr (cents)				  7.0 vs 6.9</p>
<p>    Div (cents)				  3.6 vs 3.4</p>
<p>    Total div for yr (cents)		 7.0 vs 3.4</p>
<p>    Turnover				   10.20 vs 7.92</p>
<p>    Pretax profit			     6.27 vs 6.26</p>
<p>    Tax					   1.64 vs 1.67</p>
<p>    Units outstanding (million)	  66.00 vs same</p>
<p>Note - Newmarket Property Trust is a property company</p>
</text>
